{
  "name": "dsh-workbench-templates",
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "多智能体工作台 · 模板集 v3：全部卡片由 Host SSE 推送驱动（每 500ms），实时显示会话、Agent、上下文 Token、Team 成员与任务板、工具数、事件数、内存与运行时长；任务板只保留未完成工作，提供可展开的归档历史与单条/全部删除（二次确认、CAS 校验、请求体限长与并发锁，失败只返回 JSON 错误，不影响面板与 Host）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "client.js",
    "assets/workbench-templates-v3.md",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek",
    "harness",
    "multi-agent",
    "workbench",
    "templates"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  }
}
